{"seq":2,"slug":"wide-column-timeseries","title":"宽列数据库与时序数据库选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/nosql-specialized/wide-column-timeseries","wordCount":1718,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"宽列数据库与时序数据库选型\">宽列数据库与时序数据库选型</h1><p>当数据的基数（cardinality）达到数十亿行、写入速率达到每秒数十万条记录时，传统的关系型数据库和文档数据库都会遇到根本性的扩展瓶颈。宽列数据库和时序数据库针对这类「写多读少、按时间或分区键顺序访问」的工作负载进行了存储引擎层面的专项优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>宽列和时序数据库的共同基础与关键区分：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>写优化存储引擎</strong>：LSM-tree 和列存是两者的共同基础——面向顺序写入优化，牺牲随机读性能</li>\n<li><strong>数据模型差异</strong>：宽列是稀疏多维映射（按实体组织），时序是按时间戳排序的度量流（按指标组织）</li>\n<li><strong>选型边界</strong>：按实体查所有指标选宽列，按指标跨实体聚合选时序</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"宽列数据库的数据模型\">宽列数据库的数据模型</h2><p>宽列数据库（Wide-Column Store）的核心抽象是<strong>稀疏的、多维排序映射</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">data[row\\_key][column\\_family:column\\_qualifier][timestamp] \\to value</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ey</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mn</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ami</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mn</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">am</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>与关系表的关键区别在于：每行可以有不同数量的列，列是运行时动态创建的。这种模型天然适合以下场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>行键示例</th>\n<th>列族设计</th>\n<th>为什么适合宽列</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户行为事件</td>\n<td><code>user_id#timestamp</code></td>\n<td><code>event:click</code>, <code>event:view</code></td>\n<td>列稀疏，每用户事件类型不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IoT 设备遥测</td>\n<td><code>device_id#hour</code></td>\n<td><code>metric:temp</code>, <code>metric:rpm</code></td>\n<td>写入量极大，按设备+时间分区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息存储</td>\n<td><code>conv_id#msg_time</code></td>\n<td><code>msg:body</code>, <code>msg:sender</code></td>\n<td>范围扫描（按会话取消息列表）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推荐特征表</td>\n<td><code>item_id</code></td>\n<td><code>feature:embedding</code>, <code>feature:tags</code></td>\n<td>列宽度差异极大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"主流宽列产品对比\">主流宽列产品对比</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Google&#10;        BT[Cloud Bigtable]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph AWS&#10;        KS[Amazon Keyspaces]&#10;        SC[ScyllaDB Cloud on AWS]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 开源&#10;        CS[Apache Cassandra]&#10;        SL[ScyllaDB]&#10;        HB[Apache HBase]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph Google\n        BT[Cloud Bigtable]\n    end\n    subgraph AWS\n        KS[Amazon Keyspaces]\n        SC[ScyllaDB Cloud on AWS]\n    end\n    subgraph 开源\n        CS[Apache Cassandra]\n        SL[ScyllaDB]\n        HB[Apache HBase]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>产品</th>\n<th>基于</th>\n<th>一致性</th>\n<th>最大行大小</th>\n<th>Serverless</th>\n<th>写延迟 P99</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cloud Bigtable</td>\n<td>自研</td>\n<td>强一致（单行）</td>\n<td>256 MB</td>\n<td>按节点</td>\n<td>&lt; 10ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amazon Keyspaces</td>\n<td>Cassandra 兼容</td>\n<td>可调（LOCAL_QUORUM）</td>\n<td>1 MB</td>\n<td>按需</td>\n<td>&lt; 20ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ScyllaDB Cloud</td>\n<td>Cassandra 兼容（C++重写）</td>\n<td>可调</td>\n<td>无硬限制</td>\n<td>按节点</td>\n<td>&lt; 5ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apache Cassandra</td>\n<td>自研</td>\n<td>可调</td>\n<td>2 GB（理论）</td>\n<td>自管</td>\n<td>取决于部署</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Bigtable 的独特优势</strong>：与 GCP 数据生态深度集成——BigQuery 可直接联邦查询 Bigtable、Dataflow 可流式写入、Vertex AI 可读取特征表。2026 年 Bigtable 新增 SQL 接口（Preview），降低了学习曲线。</p>\n<p><strong>ScyllaDB vs Cassandra</strong>：ScyllaDB 用 C++ 重写了 Cassandra 的 Java 代码，在相同硬件上提供 3-10x 的吞吐量改进和更低的尾部延迟（消除 GC 停顿）。对于新项目，除非已有大量 Cassandra 运维经验，否则 ScyllaDB 是更好的起点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时序数据库的设计取舍\">时序数据库的设计取舍</h2><p>时序数据库（TSDB）为<strong>按时间戳排序的度量数据</strong>优化了整个写入和查询路径。核心取舍是：牺牲通用查询能力（如任意 JOIN），换取极致的写入吞吐量和时间范围聚合性能。</p>\n<p>时序数据的典型特征：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>写入远多于读取（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{ratio} &lt; 0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span>）</li>\n<li>数据按时间递增追加，极少更新或删除</li>\n<li>查询总是包含时间范围谓词</li>\n<li>聚合（AVG、SUM、PERCENTILE）比点查更常见</li>\n<li>自然的冷热分层：近期数据热、历史数据冷</li>\n</ul>\n<p>写入速率的量化：一个有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 台服务器、每台 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 个指标、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 秒采集间隔的监控系统，写入速率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><mi>I</mi></mfrac><mtext> samples/sec</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = \\frac{N \\times M}{I} \\text{ samples/sec}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> samples/sec</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>10000 台服务器 × 200 指标 × 每 10 秒采集 = 200,000 samples/sec。这个量级对 PostgreSQL 来说是灾难性的，但对 TSDB 是常规负载。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时序数据库产品对比\">时序数据库产品对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>产品</th>\n<th>云托管</th>\n<th>存储引擎</th>\n<th>查询语言</th>\n<th>压缩率</th>\n<th>写入吞吐</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Amazon Timestream</td>\n<td>AWS 原生</td>\n<td>自研分层存储</td>\n<td>SQL 子集</td>\n<td>10:1</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>InfluxDB Cloud</td>\n<td>多云</td>\n<td>IOx（Arrow/Parquet）</td>\n<td>InfluxQL + SQL</td>\n<td>10-20:1</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TimescaleDB</td>\n<td>多云/自管</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL 扩展</td>\n<td>标准 SQL</td>\n<td>5-10:1</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Google Cloud Bigtable</td>\n<td>GCP</td>\n<td>宽列</td>\n<td>CBT CLI / HBase API</td>\n<td>变化大</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ClickHouse Cloud</td>\n<td>多云</td>\n<td>MergeTree（列存）</td>\n<td>SQL</td>\n<td>10-30:1</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QuestDB Cloud</td>\n<td>多云</td>\n<td>列存 + 向量化</td>\n<td>SQL</td>\n<td>10-15:1</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"timescaledb-vs-专用-tsdb\">TimescaleDB vs 专用 TSDB</h3><p>TimescaleDB 的独特卖点是<strong>它就是 PostgreSQL</strong>——一个扩展插件，而非独立产品。这意味着：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有 PG 生态工具（pg_dump、pgAdmin、各语言 ORM）直接可用</li>\n<li>时序表和普通关系表可以 JOIN</li>\n<li>事务、外键、触发器全部可用</li>\n</ul>\n<p>代价是在极端写入吞吐量（&gt; 100 万 samples/sec）上逊于 InfluxDB 或 ClickHouse。决策公式简单：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>如果已有 PostgreSQL 基础设施 + 写入 &lt; 50 万 samples/sec → TimescaleDB</li>\n<li>如果写入 &gt; 100 万 samples/sec + 纯时序工作负载 → InfluxDB 或 ClickHouse</li>\n<li>如果与 GCP 生态深度绑定 + 需要与 ML 管线集成 → Bigtable</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"宽列-vs-时序的选型边界\">宽列 vs 时序的选型边界</h2><p>两者经常在 IoT 和监控场景中竞争。关键区分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判断维度</th>\n<th>选宽列</th>\n<th>选时序</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>查询主体</td>\n<td>按实体查找其所有指标</td>\n<td>按指标跨所有实体聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据维度</td>\n<td>高（数千个不同列/标签）</td>\n<td>中低（固定指标集）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保留策略</td>\n<td>无自动过期</td>\n<td>内置 TTL + 降采样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态集成</td>\n<td>ML 特征表、消息归档</td>\n<td>Grafana、告警、SRE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事务需求</td>\n<td>单行原子</td>\n<td>通常不需要事务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>如果工作负载同时包含宽列和时序特征，考虑使用 <a href=\"../operations-migration/multi-database-polyglot\">多数据库混用架构</a>：宽列存储原始事件，时序数据库存储预聚合指标，通过流处理管道连接两者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本效率关键-压缩与降采样\">成本效率关键：压缩与降采样</h2><p>时序数据的成本优化主要靠两个杠杆：</p>\n<p><strong>列存压缩</strong>：时序数据的时间戳和数值列具有极高的压缩潜力。Delta-of-delta 编码 + LZ4 可将时间戳列压缩到每个数据点仅 1-2 比特。整体压缩率公式的经验值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CR \\approx \\frac{raw\\_size}{raw\\_size \\times (0.05 + 0.1 \\times cardinality\\_ratio)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3555em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3595em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ina</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>低基数（如同一设备的温度值变化小）压缩率可达 30:1，高基数（如随机 UUID）可能只有 3:1。</p>\n<p><strong>降采样（Downsampling）</strong>：将秒级原始数据聚合为分钟级/小时级/天级摘要，可将存储成本降低 60-90%。大多数 TSDB 支持自动降采样策略配置。关键原则是保留原始数据用于近期告警（如 7 天），之后自动降采样为长期趋势数据。</p>\n<p>选择产品时，需要将压缩率和降采样策略纳入 <a href=\"../selection-framework/cost-performance-modeling\">成本建模</a>——一个 10:1 压缩率的 TSDB 实际存储成本可能只有关系型方案的 1/10。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>宽列和时序数据库是高基数、写密集工作负载的两把利器。选择依据是查询的主要维度：如果核心查询是「给定设备/用户，获取其所有数据」则选宽列（Bigtable / ScyllaDB）；如果核心查询是「给定指标，跨所有设备聚合」则选时序（InfluxDB / TimescaleDB / ClickHouse）。TimescaleDB 作为 PostgreSQL 扩展的独特定位使其成为「已有 PG 基础设施 + 时序需求 &lt; 50 万 samples/sec」场景的最优选择。成本优化的核心杠杆是列存压缩（10-30x）和自动降采样（额外 60-90% 节省），建模时不可忽略。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"宽列数据库与时序数据库选型","id":"宽列数据库与时序数据库选型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"宽列数据库的数据模型","id":"宽列数据库的数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"主流宽列产品对比","id":"主流宽列产品对比"},{"level":2,"text":"时序数据库的设计取舍","id":"时序数据库的设计取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"时序数据库产品对比","id":"时序数据库产品对比"},{"level":3,"text":"TimescaleDB vs 专用 TSDB","id":"timescaledb-vs-专用-tsdb"},{"level":2,"text":"宽列 vs 时序的选型边界","id":"宽列-vs-时序的选型边界"},{"level":2,"text":"成本效率关键：压缩与降采样","id":"成本效率关键-压缩与降采样"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"文档数据库与键值存储选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/nosql-specialized/document-keyvalue-stores"},"next":{"title":"图数据库与向量数据库选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/nosql-specialized/graph-vector-databases"}}